$\n\nSo, the general solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}$ and ${x}_{3}=0,$ where ${x}_{2}$ is a free variable. Therefore, if $x\\in \\text{Null}(A),$ then\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]={x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nThis implies that \n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}\n$$\n\nis a basis of $\\text{Null}(A)$ since it is a linearly independent set and its vectors generate $\\text{Null}(A).$" 13194139535936 true] [17592186375260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375261 13194139535936 true] [17592186375260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375262 13194139535936 true] [17592186375260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375263 13194139535936 true] [17592186375260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375264 13194139535936 true] [17592186375260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375265 13194139535936 true] [17592186375260 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535936 true] [17592186375260 1041 "selection" 13194139535936 true] [17592186375260 1104 #edb/ref 17592186375264 13194139535936 true] [17592186375260 1110 #uuid "e4c8f206-1830-5d37-933f-084a762d308f" 13194139535936 true] [17592186375261 1034 "B={[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139535936 true] [17592186375261 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535936 true] [17592186375261 1111 #uuid "fb693d75-5b6c-515d-9fc4-030fa4e8010e" 13194139535936 true] [17592186375262 1034 "B={[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139535936 true] [17592186375262 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535936 true] [17592186375262 1111 #uuid "c7b95856-4090-5630-bf70-5706fd07c524" 13194139535936 true] [17592186375263 1034 "B={\\,}" 13194139535936 true] [17592186375263 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535936 true] [17592186375263 1111 #uuid "216355e0-5a04-58ff-9a23-c75e46fe0769" 13194139535936 true] [17592186375264 1034 "B={[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139535936 true] [1759218637526